# DOM test server

When serving this repo so `scripts/test-dom.html` (or other local static files) can be opened in a browser, **always** use:

```bash
python3 scripts/serve-dom-tests.py
```

Optional custom port:

```bash
python3 scripts/serve-dom-tests.py 9000
```

## Do not

```bash
# ❌ BAD — leaves orphans on 8765 when the parent shell dies
python3 -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1
```

`serve-dom-tests.py` reclaims port 8765 if a previous run is still listening, then prints the DOM test URL.
